# /help

Say this, adjusted to what's already done (check `docs/PROGRESS.md` if it exists):

> Here's what I can do for your website. Type any of these:
>
> - **/setup** — set up the site with me, step by step. Start here.
> - **/article** — write a new {{blogLabelLower}} post in your voice. I research it, cite
>   real sources, and you approve it before it goes live.
> - **/publish** — put an approved post live.
> - **/competitors** — see how the other {{competitorNoun}} websites compare and
>   where you can beat them.
> - **/reddit-ideas** — find the questions people are really asking about
>   {{topicNoun}}, and turn them into article ideas.
> - **/audit** — find weak spots on the site and fix the easy ones.
> - **/traffic** — read your Google Search Console numbers and tell you what to do.
> - **/benchmark** — score the new site against the old one, dimension by dimension.
> - **/launch** — point {{siteHost}} at the new site (with {{helperName}} on the call).
>
> Or just tell me what you want in normal words — "change Saturday hours to
> 8–11", "add a photo to the {{teamPluralLower}} page", "the pricing page has the wrong
> number" — and I'll do it and show you.
